WEBVTT

00:00.640 --> 00:02.307
Has His Majesty appeared recently?

00:04.040 --> 00:05.840
His Majesty often suffers from headaches

00:05.920 --> 00:07.320
Recently getting worse

00:07.520 --> 00:09.600
Hasn't held court for a long time

00:09.680 --> 00:10.440
All court matters

00:10.520 --> 00:12.187
Are handled by Prince Ning

00:12.400 --> 00:13.680
All edicts

00:13.760 --> 00:15.427
Are delivered by Eunuch Wen

